  "id": "USN-9208-1",
  "summary": "alsa-lib vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that the ALSA library incorrectly handled certain crafted\ntopology files and control element identifiers. An attacker could possibly\nuse these issues to cause a denial of service or expose sensitive\ninformation. These issues were only addressed in Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, Ubuntu\n24.04 LTS and Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.",
